          "A USFans hoodies spreadsheet is useful when it helps you compare a few live listings on the same basis. A product photograph and a size label do not tell you how a hoodie will fit or how much room it will occupy in a parcel. Record the source link, selected colour, size-chart method, chest width, body length, sleeve information, seller terms and the price of the exact option. Add weight and folded dimensions only when their source is clear. This guide focuses on the connection between hoodie sizing, warehouse evidence and parcel planning. It does not claim that the featured garments have been worn or independently weighed. Begin with the existing hoodies category and check the live listing before treating a saved spreadsheet entry as current."
